== 1. Exact law of T_s^k(n) mod p (n uniform mod p 2^k) against the closed form
   p =  3, s = +1: brute force = formula for k <= 12: True;  ord_p 2 = 2;  limit law 2: 2/3, 1: 1/3  [support = all units: 2 is a primitive root]
