   p = 3 reading (ensemble): for n uniform mod 3 2^k, T_+^k(n) is in class 2 with probability -> 2/3 and class 1 -> 1/3; T_- the reverse; class 0 never after the first odd step.  This is not a time average along one orbit (orbits end in cycles).

