== 7. Integer cycles of T_+ on Z from every word of length L <= 24
   118 (word, integer point) solutions; distinct integer cycle points [-136, -91, -82, -68, -61, -55, -41, -37, -34, -25, -17, -10, -7, -5, -1, 0, 1, 2]
   cycle [-136, -68, -34, -17, -25, -37, -55, -82, -41, -61, -91]: period 11, odd steps 7
   cycle [-10, -5, -7]: period 3, odd steps 2
   cycle [-1]: period 1, odd steps 1
   cycle [0]: period 1, odd steps 0
   cycle [1, 2]: period 2, odd steps 1
   T_- (3x-1) on the positive integers has exactly the negatives: {1}, {5,7,10}, {17,...,136}; T_+ on the positives only {1,2}.

